Third-party material in this repository keeps its own licence and copyright:
- docs/datasheets/ and docs/vendor/: owned by their manufacturers (Espressif,
  Goodix, Sitronix, NSIWAY, Guition); included for reference only.
- common/boards/*.json: from rzeldent/platformio-espressif32-sunton (GPL-3.0).
- common/lib/SD/: a patched copy of the arduino-esp32 SD library (Apache-2.0,
  per its source headers; see common/lib/SD/README-mini-screen.md).
- reference/: git submodules of other authors' repositories, each under its
  own licence.
- projects/05-powerwall-display/src/moon_photo.c: derived from a NASA
  Scientific Visualization Studio image (public domain).
See docs/guide/99-sources-and-credits.md for the full list and links.
